        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Nthuk pui tingmik tang ni the,",
            "Niu khuan mei Immanual;",
            "Pap le seitan man pui nung rui.",
            "Kanlou mei guai rui guang bam kariw ni.",
            "",
            "Hei, kum pui kaan khou neihlana suan ni,",
            "Pou rui dam lou mei tingsaeng gaipui ram lakhang ;",
            "He! Adih gaini na cho adih neihla ni cho?",
            "Neihla na bam taan dat pulak khe.",
            "",
            "2. Tabui nung ni cho poubaomei?",
            "Gaipui tingmik tei hou khang",
            "Jordan dui tei kanpat pukhou,",
            "Akhang tingkao ganchuang na kum gan ni.",
            "",
            "3. Kum kandiu tingsaeng Poubaomei ,",
            "Nang zei rui kan loumei guai ;",
            "Nang zei rui liu lou mei guai ta,",
            "Akhou guang o tuna saloumei tei.",
            "",
            "4. He! Namthan daimei gaiding e,",
            "Dam loumei nam thanh gaimei",
            "Ngam mei lu than gaimei guai tei,",
            "Kandih hei luaipui nung ai rui suan ni."
          ]
        }
      }
